# Kotlin layouts chosen by rows (syntax: crates/core-format/src/layout.rs); the rest is Rust.
[layout]
Class|ObjectDeclaration : heritage colon=Colon list=SuperTypeList ctor=PrimaryConstructor params=ValueParameterList min=option:class_signature_wrap_min_supertypes hug_min=option:class_signature_wrap_min_parameters
DotQualifiedExpression|SafeAccessExpression&parent!=ImportDirective|PackageDirective : chain spaced=LambdaArgument
When : cases open=Lbrace
